# Vantage theme settings (luci-theme-vantage).
#
# Appearance for every browser on this router, as picked under the theme's
# Appearance button; an option left out keeps each browser's own pick:
#
#   option theme 'auto'       auto, light or dark
#   option login 'grid'       the login page's background: grid, stars or none
#   option backdrop 'grid'    the dashboard's network path background, likewise
#   option brand 'none'       next to the logo: none, hostname or model
#
# The dashboard's Customize saves here too: its chart style (option chart) and
# one layout per screen size (option layout_wide, layout_mid, layout_narrow and
# the same with _wired), which are best changed there.

config appearance 'appearance'
